I wish to elaborate further on what I had written earlier.

(0) One is required to SUBMIT every exam and problem-set BEFORE THE DEADLIN=
E. If one is not able to or does not wish to do anything, one needs to subm=
it the top-sheet, filled in properly with 0's. OTHERWISE ONE"S COURSE GRADE=
 IS AN F. Students may speak to me in advance to determine if they have leg=
itimate reasons for not being able to meet the deadline. Such students may =
be exempted if allowed by College procedures.

(1)  If a student faces a situation that is deemed to be an emergency (base=
d on documentation provided) in accordance with College guidelines, then ap=
propriate accommodations will be found in consultation with the Department =
Chair and Division Dean on a case-by-case basis.

(2) Those who do not follow rules must take responsibility for their action=
s and face the consequences. I particularly dislike empty excuses that some=
 have sent me in the past. If one has any self-respect one should not indul=
ge in such worthless acts.

(4) One MUST read EVERY ANNOUNCEMENT and keep notes.

